<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-21T13:59:58.737Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:59:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Islamic State-linked militants attacked civilians in eastern Mali, killing dozens, while separate gunmen attacks in Mali killed over 40 civilians. In Niger, gunmen assaulted a bus, killing at least 11 passengers. Burkina Faso's military junta reinstated the death penalty as it confronts an escalating jihadist insurgency. The war, which has persisted since 2012 across Mali, Niger and Burkina Faso, caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPRDhKTTlnTVFYd3l3M3VlTHNiMXNwNE9GdkRBeGg1ZXk2eUVnRUl2c3V3Z1ZrZTk2djJLeGhIb3A1NlpTeWs2UWFtYkdhLXJjUS1aTVBfcHE2eGFwR21YdDhBOTlUVXpyb3pnX0xGRkpXaDNCM2c2LTJsNDVlaXFDUy14SWItaW5jOVBabDZZMF82em5oN2hHaFU4Vm90Tm5oVGV4ZVUzUkxLc0l0b2xTVUphUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxONnRSTkhubldTTlVKVkFVcHRadmo4VDBhZDlOekRpQ2JUUzBVV2F1amhCUkhhckR0blg4VTdHczNMeTMxaXdoVjF5b2lXdlJrR1hkOXNjQmdvRUlYZVJ3NFhQYmxMSHItYTV0cVRJeXZtbVZHQkUtUmlCRWVyTzJHdHh0R2RxNXBfakI5R1c3NUdvUlNJT1EyZzdLVmNhWFpVUDRpd3RWeFBNU0RDNUlMbTZxSy05eXFINzdoMg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Africa Report&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTFBtclp3TEQ0Ui05dVFZVHc1TVAydUlQNG5CbnZuSC1sQ2FwRmdEVUFrSTlmUWkyb3U2LVJUckFJekhmYk1rYlNSRTFkTEhEUWk3OF8ycWx4NWNTRm9CRW5OZ1BSRUlSZXVrYVZuS2ltTjF2Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;APAnews - Agence de Presse Africaine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPRGZGWnYxRW1zdUpzWlBaUWtoLVU3QjRvWkZiWEQxMGQ0M2pkbWdUSjVKNWdwR3JwX1dBQTZFVkdDQ3laVkdEZzRJdEQtcFM3RTR0MnE4X0R0c3Y4ODZnT0tlaVdPMFRDSngyd0hxcWJFdHRzaHFITElrOEowenpoYTg5U201WjhjOXMtbUVxdWlkSWg3NGFRZkRaRDlPLVY4d0N4T3ZyWU5DSjFyQ1N5Yw?oc=5&quot;&gt;streamlinefeed.co.